*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.crt
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
**/secrets/
**/secret/
**/*secret*
**/*secrets*
**/*credential*
**/*credentials*
**/*token*
**/*tokens*
**/*connection-string*
**/*connection_string*
**/*connstr*
**/*dsn*
